"""
🔥😈 PORT 777 EVIL ☠️🔥👹 :: FastAPI Backend v4

Endpoints
---------
  POST /api/login      -> HMAC session token (only if ADMIN_PASSWORD set)
  POST /api/chat       -> SSE stream (full_access gated by auth when set)
  GET  /api/status     -> agent state + providers + auth_required flag
  GET  /api/models     -> provider availability
  GET  /api/history    -> sessions (SQLite, survives restarts)
  GET  /api/history/{sid}
  GET  /api/files      / POST /api/files / DELETE /api/files
  GET  /api/system     -> host status snapshot
  GET  /api/memory     -> RAG search/list    DELETE /api/memory
  GET  /api/audit      -> Full-access action trail (auth-gated)
  GET  /api/tasks      -> scheduled agent tasks   (auth-gated to create)
  POST /api/tasks      -> schedule {prompt, interval_minutes}
  DEL  /api/tasks/{id} -> remove
Run:
    uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000
"""
